# Wave T55 (Wildreach kit): chartstand — CARTOGRAPHER WREN's chart stand: a wooden easel bearing a pale chart with a teal coastline, rust route dashes, a compass rose and the crater dot. Stands at WREN's north shoulder — her re-charting of the island made visible at her post ('I am re-charting this island at walking pace'). Fully opaque; the town grass is baked in at its measured colours (tg-pastoria #008100/#003f00). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T55-WILDREACH-PLAN.md §5.)
